  - diseaseId: GRIP
    diagnosisName: Grip
    resultText: "Belirtileriniz grip ile g\xFC\xE7l\xFC bi\xE7imde uyumlu g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor.
      Y\xFCksek ate\u015F, ani ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7, halsizlik, kas a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131
      ve kuru \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk bu tan\u0131y\u0131 destekliyor. Dinlenme, s\u0131v\u0131
      al\u0131m\u0131 ve semptomatik tedavi \xF6nerilir."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 1
    recommendedTags:
